msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"...I thought I told you to target girls. What the hell am I\r\n"
"supposed to do with this giant oaf?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Sorry, chief. But hey, he's one hefty dude... I'm sure someone would pay "
"good money for a guy like him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Maybe so..."
msgstr "Forse..."

msgctxt "140"
msgid "...Who's paying good money for me now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Oh, shit!"
msgstr "È... È morto!"

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Dude! You drank enough tranqs to knock out a sumo wrestler... Just what "
"kinda monster are you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"So that's your game. You pretend like you're a nice, helpful tour guide, "
"then kidnap girls for profit? You're the monsters here... and you're gonna "
"pay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Dammit! He's hip to the game now, boss! How are we getting outta this one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "We slit the bastard's throat to keep him quiet, that's how!"
msgstr ""

